# ScanSnap iX1300 network backend configuration.
# Add the scanner's reserved IPv4 address. Each target appears as separate
# ADF and Return Path devices so frontends with generic source names can use it.
#
# net 192.168.0.145
#
# Rotate pages by 180 degrees for sheets loaded bottom edge first, for example
# with the text upright and facing you in the ADF paper chute. Use 0 (the
# default) for sheets loaded top edge first, as the scanner manual describes.
#
# rotate adf 180
# rotate return 0
#
# Set to "no" to list only the ADF device and hide the Return Path device.
#
# return-path yes
